4 trailing line: the width of a word
6 line: a macro over three lines, with comments in the body
8 line: the larger value wins
10 line: a second comment line
12 trailing line: a trailing comment of the macro
15-16 block: the first line of a block comment the second line
19 trailing line: a string in the macro text
21 trailing line: nothing in the macro text
23 trailing line: MACROS_VH
